### Case: valid-free-call — an app subscribed to the Free product.
###
### The value here is the app's CLIENT ID, i.e. the credential KEY. It is NOT the
### app secret — key-auth validate resolves on the key and never consults the
### secret. Sending the secret is the most common cause of a surprising 401.
###
### Expect 200, and one unit consumed from the Free product's window.
GET {{GATEWAY}}/posts
apikey: {{FREE_KEY}}
accept: application/json

### curl equivalent:
###   curl -i {{GATEWAY}}/posts -H 'apikey: {{FREE_KEY}}'
